  {
    "ID": 38,
    "Personaggio/soggetto": "Clouds",
    "Film/corto": "The Good Dinosaur",
    "Anno": 2015,
    "Regista/autore": "Peter Sohn",
    "Trama": "The Good Dinosaur asks the question: What if the asteroid that forever changed life on Earth missed the planet completely and giant dinosaurs never became extinct? Pixar takes you on an epic journey into the world of dinosaurs where an Apatosaurus named Arlo makes an unlikely human friend. While traveling through a harsh and mysterious landscape, Arlo learns the power of confronting his fears and discovers what he is truly capable of.",
    "Link 1": "Trailer: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O-RgquKVTPE",
    "Link 2": null,
    "Link 3": null,
    "Categoria Innovazione (tag) 1": "Background",
    "Nome Innovazione 1": "Cloud Lego Parts (library)",
    "Paragrafo motivazione innovazione 1": "\"The Good Dinosaur\" took place entirely outside, with clouds in almost every scene. So the team decided for the first time to create entirely volumetric clouds that were actually in the scene, making this world that much more immersive.",
    "Info specifiche sul funzionamento 1": "The clouds team built a huge library of what they called \"cloud Lego parts.\" They joined these volumetric forms together to create huge clouds of every type: rain clouds, stratus clouds, and cumulus clouds.",
    "Categoria Innovazione (tag) 2": null,
    "Nome Innovazione 2": null,
    "Paragrafo Funzionamento generale 2": null,
    "Funzionamento - info maggiori su tecnologie 2": null,
