    "Personaggio/soggetto": "Skeletons",
    "Film/corto": "Coco",
    "Anno": 2017,
    "Regista/autore": "Lee Unkrich",
    "Trama": "A Boy Who Dreams Of Becoming A Great Musician embarks on an extraordinary journey to the magical land of his ancestors. There, the charming trickster Hector becomes an unexpected friend who helps Miguel uncover the mysteries behind his family’s stories and traditions.",
    "Link 1": "Trailer: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlnPHQ3TLX8",
