    "Categoria Innovazione (tag) 1": "Motion",
    "Nome Innovazione 1": "Kingpin",
    "Paragrafo motivazione innovazione 1": "as a bit of extra texture, the animation team used their proprietary tool Kingpin to add jiggle to the skeletons",
    "Info specifiche sul funzionamento 1": null,
    "Categoria Innovazione (tag) 2": "Materials",
    "Nome Innovazione 2": "New Continous Collision Detection Program",
    "Paragrafo Funzionamento generale 2": "to dress complex characters such as skeletons",
    "Funzionamento - info maggiori su tecnologie 2": "it helped the computer automatically resolve issues like cloth bunching up around a skeleton's hand or snagging on a bony knee.\nAnimators also digitally wrapped the skeletons' joints with super-stretchy invisible material, so that when the bones separated, the pants would touch that invisible barrier and not fall into the gaps.",
