    "Film/corto": "Elio",
    "Anno": 2025,
    "Regista/autore": "Adrian Molina, Domee Shi, Madeline Sharafian",
    "Trama": "For centuries, people have called out to the universe looking for answers in Disney and Pixar’s original, all-new feature film “Elio,” the universe calls back! The cosmic misadventure introduces Elio, a space fanatic with an active imagination and a huge alien obsession. “He’s an unusual kid who’s obsessed with getting abducted by aliens,” says director Domee Shi. Elio feels like there’s nothing for him on Earth—he dreams of going to another world where he’s accepted for who he is.”",
    "Link 1": "Trailer: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ETVi5_cnnaE",
    "Link 2": null,
    "Link 3": null,
    "Categoria Innovazione (tag) 1": "Lights",
    "Nome Innovazione 1": "Luna",
    "Paragrafo motivazione innovazione 1": "to create a dazzling world it was necessary to have lighting throughout the production process and not just at the final stage.",
    "Info specifiche sul funzionamento 1": "it brought Renderman to interactive workflows all across the pipeline. It allowed the team to use both illumination and camera at the same time to figure out how to guide eyes and tell a story. ",
